  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fund to Support Young Entrepreneurs, Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is: to strengthen inclusive growth for young people, especially women, driven by MSMEs aimed at increasing income, employment, and self-employment, and which generates positive environmental impacts that contribute to the circular economy.
Outcomes: 1) Enterprises (in start-up or growth phase) of young women and men supported by FACEJ II are economically viable and provide employment; and 2) FACEJ II-supported enterprises adapt to climate change through adoption of green technologies</narrative>
  </description>
